# Frontend Next.js

- App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind. Never use `any`.
- Mobile-first 390–430px inside the 5-tab bottom nav.
- Do not import vendor SDKs; call FitOS backend/domain APIs only.
- Finished workout/activity: 9:16 canvas card + `navigator.share()` for Stories.
- Lucide icons for tab chrome. Keep screens thumb-reachable; primary CTA above the tab bar.
